      "id": 21,
      "code": "G",
      "title": "Would you like…?",
      "rule": "*Would you like…?* — muloyim taklif yoki soʻrov: \"…xohlaysizmi?\" Undan keyin ot keladi: *Would you like some tea?* yoki *to + feʼl*: *Would you like to go to the park?* Javob: *Yes, please.* / *No, thank you.* Oʻzingiz xohlagan narsani muloyim aytish uchun *I'd like…* (= *I would like*) ishlatiladi: *I'd like some water, please.* Taklifda *some* ishlatamiz.",
      "examples": [
        "Would you like some tea?",
        "Would you like a sandwich?",
        "Would you like to go to the park?",
        "Yes, please. I'd like some coffee.",
        "No, thank you.",
        "I'd like to visit Samarkand."
      ],
      "words": [
        { "en": "Would you like…?", "uz": "…xohlaysizmi?" },
        { "en": "I'd like…", "uz": "men … xohlardim" },
        { "en": "Yes, please.", "uz": "Ha, iltimos." },
        { "en": "No, thank you.", "uz": "Yoʻq, rahmat." },
        { "en": "sandwich", "uz": "sendvich" },
        { "en": "ice cream", "uz": "muzqaymoq" },
        { "en": "cake", "uz": "tort" },
        { "en": "hungry", "uz": "och" }
      ],
